  // through the box center along dir = (cos θ, sin θ) / L with
  // θ = cssAngle−90° and L = |cos θ| + |sin θ| ∈ [1, √2]. Dividing by L —
  // the CSS gradient-line half-length |w·sin θcss| + |h·cos θcss| with
  // w = h = 1 — puts t = 0 / t = 1 exactly on the projections of the two
